<title>FRANCE: French Socialists did not discuss Fr. Telecom.</title>
<headline>French Socialists did not discuss Fr. Telecom.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's Socialist party did not discuss the sale of France Telecom during a meeting on Monday of its national policy-making committee, party spokesman Francois Hollande said.</p>
<p>&quot;We did not discuss it,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>He declined all further comment, saying such questions would have to wait until the formation of a new Socialist-led government this week.</p>
</text>
